                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9816d9c1-f6db-31e9-ad0e-e0f77e2b4e8d",
                        "entry_id": "1a5c6fae-4c30-3221-a3db-fc1882c4637a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. вырождаться"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f51ad8b2-b350-468e-ad59-141b20e5b003",
                                "sense_id": "9816d9c1-f6db-31e9-ad0e-e0f77e2b4e8d",
                                "text": "Вырождение дворянства Франции."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1818823f-d720-3fb9-ae58-0cabe3702ba9",
                        "entry_id": "1a5c6fae-4c30-3221-a3db-fc1882c4637a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "физ. свойство системы иметь для различных квантовомеханических состояний одинаковое значение какой-либо физической величины (обычно энергии), а также количество таких состояний"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc921400-f607-460b-84df-c24cb4e7f04f",
                                "sense_id": "1818823f-d720-3fb9-ae58-0cabe3702ba9",
                                "text": "Вырождение по спину равно двум."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f137b685-b5b7-4723-8232-78d3edad80f0",
                                "sense_id": "1818823f-d720-3fb9-ae58-0cabe3702ba9",
                                "text": "При наложении магнитного поля в связи с уменьшением симметрии системы происходит снятие энергетического вырождения орбиталей с равным моментом импульса."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f79d807a-f24d-438a-8224-a0d1364d37f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a5c6fae-4c30-3221-a3db-fc1882c4637a",
                        "target_lang_word": "degeneration",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "degeneration",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4afdbce5-5a4b-34f0-9a3b-8c105ca7a0e3",
                                        "entry_id": "7ea9ab9f-1e30-38a1-b867-90ff04ff63b5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process or state of growing worse, or the state of having become worse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a3af38a-33f7-4c26-8a45-c710ddbcd67f",
                                                "sense_id": "4afdbce5-5a4b-34f0-9a3b-8c105ca7a0e3",
                                                "text": "The modern cry of \"more liberty and less creed\" is a degeneration from a vertebrate to a jellyfish."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2cabd92-d7b2-4c38-81d8-ea2a6d17dcba",
                                                "sense_id": "4afdbce5-5a4b-34f0-9a3b-8c105ca7a0e3",
                                                "text": "Hence, regional soil degenerations and podsolization was probably an important factor contributing to the retrogressive change in the forest composition at the end of the mesocratic phase.."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c65364fb-d173-4b3a-9108-4368999ecae0",
                                                "sense_id": "4afdbce5-5a4b-34f0-9a3b-8c105ca7a0e3",
                                                "text": "Emmanuel Macron sounded like a man in grief. Not angry, not defiant, just a little triste. Europe, he lamented, was suffering a “degeneration of democracy”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f61de34b-a49d-3aad-b9f5-99c2bf9a49b4",
                                        "entry_id": "7ea9ab9f-1e30-38a1-b867-90ff04ff63b5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That condition of a tissue or an organ in which its vitality has become either diminished or perverted; a substitution of a lower for a higher form of structure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e8b33d1-bb0c-46de-b03e-7b91f3856408",
                                                "sense_id": "f61de34b-a49d-3aad-b9f5-99c2bf9a49b4",
                                                "text": "fatty degeneration of the liver"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15d1f5f4-f52f-31c9-9e1c-068f43593dc5",
                                        "entry_id": "7ea9ab9f-1e30-38a1-b867-90ff04ff63b5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gradual deterioration, from natural causes, of any class of animals or plants or any particular organ or organs; hereditary degradation of type."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c63b31a-6733-30de-a4ee-06ac9cf0e61d",
                                        "entry_id": "7ea9ab9f-1e30-38a1-b867-90ff04ff63b5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thing that has degenerated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4da275f-1e0d-4a4a-a59c-3c8b5b647b7d",
                                                "sense_id": "5c63b31a-6733-30de-a4ee-06ac9cf0e61d",
                                                "text": "cockle, aracus, […] and other degenerations"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d3ae2e70-8aa8-4b09-95d4-a72166f6b7be",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a5c6fae-4c30-3221-a3db-fc1882c4637a",
                        "target_lang_word": "devolution",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "devolution",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "450daaae-39f7-3154-9ef6-8fc96d99b67b",
                                        "entry_id": "b15fafd2-d658-3047-9543-273ecd3f3c3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A rolling down."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c86a5243-d6c2-38a0-b9d6-dc889d77b2dc",
                                        "entry_id": "b15fafd2-d658-3047-9543-273ecd3f3c3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A descent, especially one that passes through a series of revolutions, or by succession."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fab36a9b-6ace-35c8-bf82-522c57eefdf0",
                                        "entry_id": "b15fafd2-d658-3047-9543-273ecd3f3c3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The transference of a right to a successor, or of a power from one body to another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef3054a7-c563-3b27-a14f-83876e47843b",
                                        "entry_id": "b15fafd2-d658-3047-9543-273ecd3f3c3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Degeneration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d819d6b-b0ca-48de-9c53-cccb607fbb30",
                                                "sense_id": "ef3054a7-c563-3b27-a14f-83876e47843b",
                                                "text": "It is quite disheartening to witness the devolution of our nation's political discourse over the past several years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d019ec55-fe8b-47d5-8c3b-4336ac577c4b",
                                                "sense_id": "ef3054a7-c563-3b27-a14f-83876e47843b",
                                                "text": "He is the place where the devolution from Heaven and the evolution from earth meet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81d6f66d-34c9-3c9b-8792-0047c9781305",
                                        "entry_id": "b15fafd2-d658-3047-9543-273ecd3f3c3c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The transfer of some powers and the delegation of some functions from a central government to local government (e.g. from the U.K. parliament to Scottish parliament and Welsh assembly)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1219e3ec-7c20-428b-a836-1ab07675354a",
                                                "sense_id": "81d6f66d-34c9-3c9b-8792-0047c9781305",
                                                "text": "The question of whether England should receive devolution like Scotland and Wales have has dogged British politics for years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1a1a15e-afbd-4ac2-bfad-2e3fb414c292",
                                                "sense_id": "81d6f66d-34c9-3c9b-8792-0047c9781305",
                                                "text": "Governments like devolution because it gives ministers someone else to blame for problems."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74cd0ba3-1e52-4d9f-bd48-8317cdfd3849",
                                                "sense_id": "81d6f66d-34c9-3c9b-8792-0047c9781305",
                                                "text": "By the 1974 general election, the Scottish National Party (SNP) were polling at 30% and there were growing calls for devolution."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
